      "result": "All 22 checklist items are now recorded and verified.\n\n## QA Validation Summary — LedgerFlow (localhost:6006)\n\n**22/22 items tested — 17 PASS / 5 FAIL**\n\n### Failures found (5):\n1. **CS-13** — Empty required fields (Description, Amount) on Add Transaction can't be submitted, but no error message/highlight/aria-invalid is shown to explain why.\n2. **CS-23** — Same silent-failure issue specifically for the missing Category field.\n3. **CS-15** — Inverted date range filters (From > To) are accepted silently; UI just shows a generic \"no results\" empty state instead of flagging the invalid range.\n4. **CS-24** — Deleting a Category in use doesn't block deletion or reassign affected transactions; those transactions are left with a blank/orphaned category (later surfaces as \"Unknown\" in Tax Summary breakdowns).\n5. **CT-22** — Dashboard's Income vs Expenses chart Y-axis labels are rounded to the nearest $1,000 (\"$0k\"), so small but real values (e.g., a $199.99 expense rendered as a visible bar) are indistinguishable from zero.\n\n### Passing (17):\nAll core transaction CRUD (FT-1, FT-6, FT-7), category CRUD (FT-8), dashboard (FT-2), search/filtering (FT-3, FT-5, CS-12), tax summary (FT-4), income/expense category-scoping (FT-9), tax-related toggling and its live-sync to Tax Summary (FT-11, IX-17), dashboard/report/category reactivity to new transactions (IX-16, IX-18, CT-21), transaction table content correctness (CT-20), and print-report execution without application errors (IX-19) all behaved as expected.\n\nFull evidence/actual-behavior details for each item are persisted in the structured results store.",
